Subject: [PATCH 0025] rs480: per-domain force-clock-then-read node (VIP/CAP)

Expand the safe register surface for clock-gated domains where the SCLK_CNTL
FORCE bit provably gates the clock.  radeon_rs480_force_clock_read, armed by
radeon_rs480_force_clock_index (default -1), forces the domain SCLK_CNTL FORCE
bit on, reads with RREG32, and restores SCLK_CNTL.  Table holds only VIP/CAP
(FORCE_VIP, bit 23); FORCE_IDCT does not de-risk IDCT so it is excluded.
Grounded in the 2026-06-12 two-wedge-class finding.

